      `the national judicial authority is verifying the proportionality of the coercive measures` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `Arts 72 to 79 party` `Art 75a act`
`Art 75a(4) the national judicial authority's bar on reviewing the necessity of the investigation` MEANS
    IF (NOT (`Arts 72 to 79 the group General applies on the date asked` `the date asked`)) OR (NOT `the national judicial authority is verifying the proportionality of the coercive measures`)
    THEN FULFILLED  -- nothing is barred: the group General does not apply on the date asked, or the facts the bar is about do not all hold
    ELSE
