        HENCE FULFILLED

-- src:1214 | 6. In addition to the powers set out in paragraph 1 of this Article, the AI Office, in the exercise of its competences referred to in Article 75(1), may:
-- src:1215 | (a) order operators to provide access to, and explanations relating to, their AI systems;
-- src:1216 | (b) impose an obligation on an operator to retain all data and documents deemed to be necessary to assess the implementation of and compliance with the obligations under this Regulation.
@ref Art 75a(6) point (b) (src:1214-1216)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the AI Office is exercising its competences referred to in Article 75(1)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the data and documents are deemed to be necessary to assess the implementation of and compliance with the obligations under this Regulation` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 75a(6)(b) the AI Office may impose an obligation on an operator to retain all data and documents` MEANS
    IF NOT (`Arts 72 to 79 the group General applies on the date asked` `the date asked`)
    THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the group General applies from the date Art 113 gives
    ELSE IF `the AI Office is exercising its competences referred to in Article 75(1)` AND `the data and documents are deemed to be necessary to assess the implementation of and compliance with the obligations under this Regulation`
         THEN JUST TRUE
         ELSE NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the power is limited to data and documents "deemed to be necessary to assess the implementation of and compliance with the obligations", with no "only"

-- src:1214 | 6. In addition to the powers set out in paragraph 1 of this Article, the AI Office, in the exercise of its competences referred to in Article 75(1), may:
-- src:1215 | (a) order operators to provide access to, and explanations relating to, their AI systems;
-- src:1216 | (b) impose an obligation on an operator to retain all data and documents deemed to be necessary to assess the implementation of and compliance with the obligations under this Regulation.
@ref Art 75a(6) point (b) (src:1214-1216)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the AI Office is exercising its competences referred to in Article 75(1)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the data and documents are deemed to be necessary to assess the implementation of and compliance with the obligations under this Regulation` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `Arts 72 to 79 party` `Art 75a act`
`Art 75a(6)(b) the AI Office's choice to impose an obligation on an operator to retain data and documents` MEANS
    IF (NOT (`Arts 72 to 79 the group General applies on the date asked` `the date asked`)) OR (NOT `the AI Office is exercising its competences referred to in Article 75(1)`) OR (NOT `the data and documents are deemed to be necessary to assess the implementation of and compliance with the obligations under this Regulation`)
    THEN FULFILLED  -- nothing is owed: the group General does not apply on the date asked, or the conditions of the duty are not met
    ELSE
        PARTY `Arts 72 to 79 party AI Office`
        MAY `Art 75a(6) impose an obligation on an operator to retain all data and documents deemed to be necessary`
        HENCE FULFILLED

§ `Article 75a(7) and (8): experts and use of information`

-- src:1217 | 7. To assist it in monitoring the effective implementation and compliance with the relevant provisions of this Regulation and to provide it with specific expertise or knowledge in the exercise of its competences under Article 75(1), the AI Office may appoint independent external experts and auditors, as well as experts, investigative teams and auditors from the Member State’s competent authorities with the agreement of the authority concerned. Information obtained as a result of such monitoring actions shall be shared with the relevant competent authorities of the Member States.
@ref Art 75a(7) first sentence (src:1217)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the appointment is to assist the AI Office in monitoring the effective implementation and compliance with the relevant provisions of this Regulation or to provide it with specific expertise or knowledge in the exercise of its competences under Article 75(1)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 75a(7) first sentence the AI Office may appoint independent external experts and auditors` MEANS
    IF NOT (`Arts 72 to 79 the group General applies on the date asked` `the date asked`)
    THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the group General applies from the date Art 113 gives
    ELSE IF `the appointment is to assist the AI Office in monitoring the effective implementation and compliance with the relevant provisions of this Regulation or to provide it with specific expertise or knowledge in the exercise of its competences under Article 75(1)`
         THEN JUST TRUE
         ELSE NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the power is for the purposes the sentence names, with no "only"

-- src:1217 | 7. To assist it in monitoring the effective implementation and compliance with the relevant provisions of this Regulation and to provide it with specific expertise or knowledge in the exercise of its competences under Article 75(1), the AI Office may appoint independent external experts and auditors, as well as experts, investigative teams and auditors from the Member State’s competent authorities with the agreement of the authority concerned. Information obtained as a result of such monitoring actions shall be shared with the relevant competent authorities of the Member States.
