      `the authority concerned has agreed` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 75a(7) first sentence the AI Office may appoint experts, investigative teams and auditors from the competent authorities of the Member States` MEANS
    IF NOT (`Arts 72 to 79 the group General applies on the date asked` `the date asked`)
    THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the group General applies from the date Art 113 gives
