-- src:1218 | 8. Information collected pursuant to this Article shall be used only for the purpose of this Regulation.
@ref Art 75a(8) (src:1218)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the use is for a purpose other than the purpose of this Regulation` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 75a(8) the information collected pursuant to this Article is barred from being used for a purpose other than the purpose of this Regulation` MEANS
    IF NOT (`Arts 72 to 79 the group General applies on the date asked` `the date asked`)
    THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the group General applies from the date Art 113 gives
    ELSE IF `the use is for a purpose other than the purpose of this Regulation`
         THEN JUST TRUE  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Information collected pursuant to this Article shall be used only for the purpose of this Regulation" (a closed "only": the bar holds for any other purpose)
         ELSE NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the bar is about information "collected pursuant to this Article"

-- src:1218 | 8. Information collected pursuant to this Article shall be used only for the purpose of this Regulation.
@ref Art 75a(8) (src:1218)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the use is for a purpose other than the purpose of this Regulation` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `Arts 72 to 79 party` `Art 75a act`
`Art 75a(8) the AI Office's bar on using the information for another purpose` MEANS
    IF (NOT (`Arts 72 to 79 the group General applies on the date asked` `the date asked`)) OR (NOT `the use is for a purpose other than the purpose of this Regulation`)
    THEN FULFILLED  -- nothing is barred: the group General does not apply on the date asked, or the facts the bar is about do not all hold
    ELSE
        PARTY `Arts 72 to 79 party AI Office`
        SHANT `Art 75a(8) use the information collected pursuant to this Article for a purpose other than the purpose of this Regulation`
        HENCE FULFILLED
        LEST BREACH BY `Arts 72 to 79 party AI Office` BECAUSE "the information collected pursuant to this Article was used for a purpose other than the purpose of this Regulation"
